claim.claim-text:
determining whether a digital signal includes a first signal originating from a first species of nuclei of a subject;
in response to a determination that the digital signal includes the first signal,
processing, via a first channel selected by the signal processing channel (1010), the first signal to obtain a first intermediate frequency (IF) signal with a first bit-width;
determining whether the digital signal includes a second signal originating from a second species of nuclei of the subject; and
in response to a determination that the digital signal includes the second signal,
